        2578,
        1723
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, emergency orders previously issued did not provide or require a plan for actions that would enable DOC to come into compliance with applicable laws and regulations for which compliance is not required as a result of such orders; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1667,
