      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. By no later than February 19, 2026, which is forty-five (45) days from the effective date of this order, DOC, in consultation with the Law Department, shall develop and submit to the Mayor a plan for DOC to achieve full compliance with applicable laws and regulations that presently do not apply pursuant to Emergency Executive Orders.",
